## CatalogSupplementalApi

### Get local inventory items (POST)
## Get local inventory items (POST)
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/{{catalog_id}}/local_inventory_items/query?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "item_filters": "<string>"
}


### Operate on local inventory item batch
## Operate on local inventory item batch
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/{{catalog_id}}/local_inventory_items/batch?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "operations": "<string>"
}


### Create local stores
## Create local stores
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/{{catalog_id}}/local_stores?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Delete local stores
## Delete local stores
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/{{catalog_id}}/local_stores?ids={{ids}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### List local stores
## List local stores
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/{{catalog_id}}/local_stores?ids={{ids}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Update local stores
## Update local stores
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/{{catalog_id}}/local_stores?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get supplemental items batch status
## Get supplemental items batch status
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/{{catalog_id}}/supplemental_items/batch/{{batch_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json
